！废诏一下，凤辰宫，尸横遍地，血气冲天！本来金碧辉煌的宫殿，被染成了赤目的红色，到处充斥着一股令人作呕的血腥味！“皇上，您要杀的人是臣妾，求您放过臣妾年迈的爹娘！”伍辰儿跪在商离天金靴前，苦苦哀求。“今天，你们谁也别想活着离开这里！”如地狱般冷酷无情的声音从商离天口中溢出。“皇上！”柔弱的声音蓦然从门口传来，美如病西施的叶子情俏盈盈地走了进来。“爱妃！”商离天一反刚才冰冷的模样，满脸温柔地迎上去，将叶子情扶到一旁坐下，并冲一旁的宫女吼道：“你们好大的胆子！居然敢把娘娘带这种地方来！”叶子连忙伸出柔弱的小手制止：“皇上，您不要怪她们，是臣妾自己要来的！”眼神移到跪在地上的伍辰儿脸上：“再怎么说，辰儿是臣妾的好姐妹，还有伍伯父和伍伯母也曾待臣妾如亲女，于情于理，臣妾都应该过来送他们最后一程！”她的声音柔弱至极，梨花带雨，令人听了不由得心生怜惜，商离天更是心疼地抚着她。只是，叶子情的声音听在伍辰儿的心里，却有如魔音一般！如果不是这个‘好姐妹’，她伍辰儿何以落得个身败名裂，还连累九族陪葬的份！“皇上，请看在老臣一生为国的份上，让老臣代她们死吧！”伍辰儿的爹伍思文亦不停地朝商离天磕着，连额头都磕出了血！“君要臣死，臣不得不死！天明，还不动手！”商离天不为所动，话里没有一丝温度。“皇上，老臣只求代她们一死……”话还未说完，闪着寒光的利剑已经抹向他的脖颈，顿时鲜血四溅，他未说完的话也戛然而止！“老爷！老……”柳氏想要扑上去，可是只扑到一半，叶天明手中那把剑也已抹上了她的脖颈，她连哼都未曾哼一声，便已追随老爷而去！“爹！娘！”叶天明是商国第一勇士，他的剑快得只在眨眼之间，等伍辰儿回过神来时，爹娘已双双倒在血泊之中，任凭她如何呼唤，爹娘再听不到她的声音！灭族之痛，双亲惨死，这一切都是源于她曾最深爱的男人，和曾经视为亲人的好姐妹！伍辰儿觉得身心像被人活活撕裂了一般痛楚！“皇上，臣妾与你夫妻一场，我爹娘亦是你爹娘，你居然如此狠心？叶子情！叶天明！我爹娘待你们如亲生，你们居然恩将仇报！你们就不怕遭天打雷劈吗？”她冲着他们嘶吼着，作势就要朝叶子情扑去！一样的穿越，一样的重生，却是不一样的故事，亦正亦邪的主角，绝对震憾！坑品保证～～记得点‘加入书架’哦", "source": "www.quanwenyuedu.io", "source_url": "https://www.quanwenyuedu.io/n/dizhenhuanzhizuidufeifei/1.html", "_fixed": true, "content_en": "first The hatred of genocide: \"How can a woman like this, who is so incompetent, be worthy of being my concubine? She is given the death penalty of having her heart cut out! All people with the surname Wu will be killed by the nine tribes!\" Once the golden mouth was opened, no one from the nine tribes surnamed Wu survived, and the blood flowed like a river... ...August 15th is the Mid-Autumn Festival, the day when thousands of families are reunited. It is also the day when the new king of the Shang Kingdom, Shang Litian, ascends the throne. Concubine Chen, who has served in the court, is waiting for the imperial edict to be conferred the title of empress, but unexpectedly what she is waiting for is a repeal of the imperial edict! After abolishing the imperial edict, Fengchen Palace was filled with corpses and blood! The originally magnificent palace was dyed red, and there was a disgusting smell of blood everywhere! \"Your Majesty, the person you want to kill is my concubine. Please spare my concubine's elderly parents!\" Wu Chen'er knelt in front of Shang Litian's golden boots and begged. \"Today, none of you can leave here alive!\" A voice as cold and ruthless as hell spilled out of Shang Litian's mouth. \"Your Majesty!\" A soft voice suddenly came from the door, and Ye Zi, who was as beautiful as a sickly beauty, came in lovingly. \"My beloved concubine!\" Shang Litian turned away from his cold demeanor and went up to him with a gentle face. He helped Ye Ziqing to sit down and shouted at the palace maid beside him: \"You are so brave! How dare you bring your empress to a place like this!\" Ye Zi quickly stretched out his weak hand to stop him: \"Your Majesty, don't blame them. It was the concubine who came here herself!\" His eyes moved to the face of Wu Chen'er who was kneeling on the ground: \"After all, Chen'er is my good sister, and Uncle Wu and Aunt Wu also treated me like my own daughter. For reasons of love and reason, I should come and see them off for the last time!\" Her voice was so soft, like pear blossoms with rain, that people couldn't help but feel pity after hearing it, and Shang Litian caressed her even more. However, Ye Ziqing's voice sounded like a demonic voice in Wu Chen'er's heart! If it weren't for this 'good sister', why would she, Wu Chen'er, be in ruins and be buried with all nine clans? \"Your Majesty, please let me die on their behalf for the sake of serving the country all my life!\" Wu Chen'er's father, Wu Siwen, kept kowtowing to Shang Litian, even his forehead was bleeding! \"If you want me to die, I have to die! It's dawn and you still haven't taken action!\" Shang Litian was unmoved, and there was no warmth in his words. \"Your Majesty, I just want to die on their behalf...\" Before he could finish his words, the gleaming sword had already touched his neck, blood spattered everywhere, and his unfinished words came to an abrupt end! \"Master! Old...\" Ms. Liu wanted to pounce, but she only managed to get halfway. The sword in Ye Tianming's hand had already touched her neck, and she followed the master without even making a sound! \"Father! Mother!\" Ye Tianming is the number one warrior in the Shang Kingdom. His sword is so fast that it only takes the blink of an eye. When Wu Chen'er came back to his senses, both his father and mother had fallen into a pool of blood. No matter how she called, her father and mother could no longer hear her voice! The pain of genocide and the tragic death of her parents all stemmed from the man she once loved most and the good sisters she once regarded as relatives! Wu Chen'er felt as if her body and mind were being torn apart alive! \"Your Majesty, I am a husband and wife with you. My father and mother are also your parents, how can you be so cruel? Ye Ziqing! Ye Tianming! My father and mother treat you as if they were your own children, and you actually repay kindness with hatred! Aren't you afraid of being struck by thunder from the sky?\" She roared at them, pretending to pounce on Ye Ziqing! The same time travel, the same rebirth, but a different story. The protagonist is both good and evil. It is absolutely shocking! Guaranteed good quality~~Remember to click ‘Add to Bookshelf’", "title_en": "Chapter 1"}